                                "sense_id": "01924e25-d2ed-31db-b4c0-5900cb108dcb",
                                "text": "[I]n the niches, instead of the effigies of mailed warriors, stood stuffed-out dresses, such as are worn by the fashionables of the day. […] It was a masterpiece of incongruity — blending in its forms Gothic romance with modern tailorism; […]"
                            },
