                                "sense_id": "01924e25-d2ed-31db-b4c0-5900cb108dcb",
                                "text": "The Yiddish Theatre had just begun to extricate itself from the claws of tailorism. Only since 1914 has there been a Yiddish daily not permeated by the spirit of tailorism, The Day."
                            }
                        ]
